msgid ""
"<qt>When clicking <b>Close</b>, this dialog will be closed with no further "
"action taken.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Se preme <b>Pechar</b>, pechará este diálogo sen facer nengunha outra "
"acción.</qt>"

#: appletbrowser.cpp:364
msgid "Add selected widgets"
msgstr "Engade os widgets escollidos"

#: appletbrowser.cpp:365
msgid ""
"<qt>When clicking <b>Add Widget</b>, the selected widgets will be added to "
"your desktop.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Se preme <b>Engadir o widget</b>, os widgets escollidos serán engadidos "
"ao seu escritorio.</qt>"

#: appletbrowser.cpp:366
msgid "Install new widgets"
msgstr "Instala novos widgets"

#: appletbrowser.cpp:367
msgid ""
"<qt>Selecting <b>Get New Widgets</b> will show a window that allows you to "
"download new widgets directly from the Internet, while Install From File "
"allows you to add new widgets from files you have on disk.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Se escolle <b>Instalar novos widgets</b> mostrarase unha fiestra que lle "
"permite obter widgets directamente de internet, mentres que Instalar dun "
"ficheiro permítelle engadir widgets que estexan en ficheiros que teña no "
"disco.</qt>"

